 "remarks": "Welcome to Sono Lofts! This is one of Norwalk's Luxury SONO condominium communities. Located in vibrant downtown Norwalk & within walking distance to Norwalk's BEST restaurants, bars & more. The SONO Collection, AMC Movie Theatre, Veterans Park(Oyster Fest), Popular Maritime Aquarium, and Oyster Park all nearby. Calf Pasture Beach, Both Train Stations + All major highways minutes away. Commuter friendly. This building is newer, built in 2004, with plenty of amenities. Gorgeous lobby. Includes a clean & comfortable fitness center, a bicycle storage area, and a fenced storage area divided per unit. 1 Assigned space in covered parking garage & plenty of guest parking. Elevator Access. Unit 401 is on the 4th floor top level, with exquisite views of the neighboring area. Entirely open layout with a sizable kitchen and living room at the center. 9+ foot ceilings and tall windows. Plenty of natural light. Concrete floors throughout give a sleek industrial vibe. Modern kitchen with stainless steel appliances, perfect for entertaining guests. Ample closet/cabinet space. Laundry in unit a perk that most buildings in area don't offer. Subway tiled bathroom with concrete floors & newer vanity/tub. Primary Bedroom includes TWO double closets and additional room for office space, dressers & more. Central air cooling & natural gas heat, hot water & cooking keep the utilities cost LOW! HOA cost is $440/month and management is wonderful and responsive. Pet friendly building!",
